[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2452516642","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98736#issuecomment-2452516642","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98736","id":2452516642,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SLm8i","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-01T20:07:02Z","updated_at":"2024-11-01T20:07:02Z","body":"This should only be exposing the functions that need to be exposed. Its bad enough that we have editor code in our scene functions, we shouldn't make the situation worse by unconditionally exposing editor code.\r\n\r\nI would limit this PR to just the functions that are breaking builds currently. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2452516642/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2452525372","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98736#issuecomment-2452525372","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98736","id":2452525372,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SLpE8","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-01T20:13:56Z","updated_at":"2024-11-01T20:13:56Z","body":"@clayjohn:\r\n\r\n> we shouldn't make the situation worse by unconditionally exposing editor code.\r\n\r\nIt not quite unconditionally: this is only for debug builds.\r\n\r\nBut I don't do too much work in the editor, so I'm not the one to say whether or not including these functions in debug builds is problematic.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2452525372/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2452537586","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98736#issuecomment-2452537586","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98736","id":2452537586,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SLsDy","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-01T20:23:32Z","updated_at":"2024-11-01T20:23:32Z","body":"> But I don't do too much work in the editor, so I'm not the one to say whether or not including these functions in debug builds is problematic.\r\n\r\nIts not that it will be problematic at run time. The problem is that this reinforces the coupling between the editor and the scene system. Ideally we would have no editor-only code in the scene code. We made compromises for specific functions, but we protected them behind an editor check. Now we are removing that check and exposing them more widely. A new contributor may now unknowingly use these functions elsewhere. Then we may see requests to expose this code to runtime. Then we end up with bloat and technical debt. \r\n\r\nIdeally in cases like this we would provide an API through the scene system that allows moving all the editor logic into the editor rather than piling on editor logic into the scene system. \r\n\r\nA good illustration of this problem is in our best practices guideline. Prefer Local Solutions:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/best_practices_for_engine_contributors.html#prefer-local-solutions","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2452537586/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2452632108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98736#issuecomment-2452632108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98736","id":2452632108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SMDIs","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-01T21:44:01Z","updated_at":"2024-11-01T21:44:01Z","body":"@clayjohn Understood, changes made.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2452632108/reactions"